  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Revitalizing STEM education to equip next generations with STEM competency</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The present project will be guided by UNESCO Medium Term Strategy and UNESCO Programme and Budget (C/5) priorities and strategic objectives. This project will be co-led by the Science and Education teams within the Regional Bureau with backstopping from both sectors at headquarters. The goal of this regional project is to support Member States of UNESCO in the region in improving STEM education by cocreating innovative educational solutions, increasing institutional and professional capabilities, sharing knowledge and best practices to the regional and global levels.</narrative>
  </description>
